@startuml
allowmixing
title 5G Architecture (NG-RAN + 5GC + IMS) — Component Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

' ============================================================
' UE + RAN
' ============================================================
rectangle "UE" as UEBOX {
  component "UE\n(USIM, SUPI/SUCI,\nNAS + PDU sessions)" as UE
}

rectangle "NG-RAN" as RANBOX {
  component "gNB\n(5G Base Station)" as GNB
}

' ============================================================
' 5G Core NFs
' ============================================================
rectangle "5GC (5G Core)" as CORE {

  component "AMF\nAccess & Mobility\n(NAS termination)" as AMF
  component "SMF\nSession Mgmt\n(PDU sessions)" as SMF
  component "UPF\nUser Plane\n(Packet forwarding)" as UPF

  component "AUSF\nAuthentication" as AUSF
  component "UDM\nSubscriber DB" as UDM
  component "ARPF\nAuth Vector Gen" as ARPF

  component "PCF\nPolicy Control" as PCF
  component "NRF\nNF Registry/Discovery" as NRF
  component "NSSF\nSlice Selection" as NSSF
}

' ============================================================
' IMS for Voice
' ============================================================
rectangle "IMS (VoNR)" as IMSBOX {
  component "P-CSCF\nSIP Proxy" as PCSCF
  component "S-CSCF\nSIP Serving" as SCSCF
  component "IMS AS\n(TAS/AS)" as IMSAS
}

' ============================================================
' External Network
' ============================================================
rectangle "External Networks" as EXT {
  cloud "DN / Internet" as DN
  cloud "PSTN\n(optional)" as PSTN
}

' ============================================================
' Interfaces / connectivity
' ============================================================

' Radio
UE --> GNB : 5G NR Air\n(AS: RRC/PDCP/RLC/MAC/PHY)

' Control plane (N2)
GNB --> AMF : N2\n(Control Plane, NAS)

' User plane (N3)
GNB --> UPF : N3\n(User Plane, GTP-U)

' UPF to data network
UPF --> DN : N6\n(IP traffic)

' SMF programs UPF
SMF --> UPF : N4\n(PDR/FAR/QER rules)

' SBA / service calls (HTTP2 APIs)
AMF --> NRF : NF Discovery
SMF --> NRF : NF Discovery
AUSF --> NRF : NF Discovery

AMF --> AUSF : Nausf\n(UE Authentication)
AUSF --> UDM : Nudm\n(Auth data)
UDM --> ARPF : Generate AV\n(RAND,AUTN,XRES*)

AMF --> PCF : Npcf\n(AM policy)
SMF --> PCF : Npcf\n(SM policy)

AMF --> NSSF : Nnssf\n(Slice selection)

' Voice/IMS
UE --> PCSCF : SIP Signaling\n(VoNR)
PCSCF --> SCSCF : SIP core
SCSCF --> IMSAS : Service logic
IMSAS --> PSTN : Interconnect\n(optional)

note bottom
Key Split:
- Control Plane: UE NAS -> gNB -> AMF (N2) + SBA calls inside 5GC
- User Plane: UE data -> gNB -> UPF (N3) -> DN (N6)
- SMF configures UPF using N4 rules.
end note

@enduml
